{"clips":[{"id":"sir-no-sir","tags":["fall","bail"],"start":0.0,"dur":1.42,"text":"Sir, no, sir!"},{"id":"yes-sir","tags":["bail"],"start":1.67,"dur":0.93,"text":"...Yes, sir!"},{"id":"code-red","tags":["bail","wave"],"start":2.85,"dur":7.86,"text":"All right men, you heard him! Code Red, repeat: We are at Code Red! Recon Plan Charlie, execute! Let's move, move, move, move, move!"},{"id":"pack-it-up","tags":["land","win"],"start":10.96,"dur":3.49,"text":"Mission accomplished! Well done, men! Pack it up, we're going home."},{"id":"battleship","tags":["bail","heli","explore"],"start":14.7,"dur":4.79,"text":"It's a big one... It's a... It's a board game! Repeat: Battleship!"},{"id":"downdraft","tags":["chute"],"start":19.74,"dur":1.79,"text":"Look out for the downdraft!"},{"id":"drifting","tags":["chute"],"start":21.78,"dur":2.03,"text":"You are drifting off course!"},{"id":"freak-out","tags":["intro","fall","buddy"],"start":24.06,"dur":2.19,"text":"Do not freak out, soldier!"},{"id":"breathe","tags":["chute","fall","buddy"],"start":26.5,"dur":1.9,"text":"Relax and remember to breathe."},{"id":"eye-on-phone","tags":["heli","explore"],"start":28.65,"dur":1.62,"text":"Keep your eye on that phone."},{"id":"give-me-twenty","tags":["shot","buddy"],"start":30.52,"dur":1.38,"text":"Drop and give me twenty!"},{"id":"best-you-can-do","tags":["miss","hardland"],"start":32.15,"dur":2.04,"text":"Is that the best you can do?"},{"id":"thinking","tags":["miss","fall","bail"],"start":34.44,"dur":1.31,"text":"What were you thinking?!"},{"id":"not-how","tags":["miss","hardland"],"start":36.0,"dur":2.08,"text":"That is not how it's done."},{"id":"kidding-me","tags":["miss","fall","bail"],"start":38.33,"dur":2.37,"text":"You have got to be kidding me!"},{"id":"try-again","tags":["again","buddy"],"start":40.95,"dur":1.56,"text":"Let's try again."},{"id":"dont-pout","tags":["shot","buddy"],"start":42.76,"dur":3.02,"text":"Soldiers don't pout. Do it again!"},{"id":"pick-yourself-up","tags":["shot","buddy","hardland"],"start":46.03,"dur":3.03,"text":"Pick yourself up, soldier, and try it again!"},{"id":"make-me-sick","tags":["shot","duck-over"],"start":49.31,"dur":2.08,"text":"You make me sick! Start over!"},{"id":"write-home","tags":["shot","duck-over"],"start":51.64,"dur":3.16,"text":"Write home, soldier, and tell 'em you're pathetic!"},{"id":"good-work","tags":["good","land","cleared","duck-hit"],"start":55.05,"dur":1.19,"text":"Good work, soldier!"},{"id":"mission-accomplished","tags":["cleared","win"],"start":56.49,"dur":3.41,"text":"All right! Mission accomplished!"},{"id":"asset","tags":["good","win","duck-perfect"],"start":60.15,"dur":3.08,"text":"You are an asset to toys everywhere!"},{"id":"medal","tags":["good","land","cleared","duck-hit"],"start":63.48,"dur":2.09,"text":"What do you want, a medal?"},{"id":"how-you-do-it","tags":["good","land","duck-hit"],"start":65.82,"dur":1.41,"text":"That's how you do it!"},{"id":"promotion","tags":["win","duck-perfect"],"start":67.48,"dur":2.4,"text":"I'm recommending you for a promotion. Great job!"},{"id":"move-move-move","tags":["wave","start","heli"],"start":70.13,"dur":5.37,"text":"Yes, sir! You heard him, men: Move, move, move!"},{"id":"grunt-1","tags":["grunt"],"start":75.75,"dur":1.13,"text":""},{"id":"grunt-2","tags":["grunt"],"start":77.13,"dur":0.82,"text":""},{"id":"grunt-3","tags":["grunt"],"start":78.2,"dur":0.64,"text":""},{"id":"grunt-4","tags":["grunt"],"start":79.09,"dur":0.52,"text":""},{"id":"grunt-5","tags":["grunt"],"start":79.86,"dur":0.39,"text":""},{"id":"grunt-6","tags":["grunt"],"start":80.5,"dur":0.32,"text":""},{"id":"oof-1","tags":["oof"],"start":81.07,"dur":0.38,"text":""},{"id":"oof-2","tags":["oof"],"start":81.7,"dur":0.76,"text":""},{"id":"oof-3","tags":["oof"],"start":82.71,"dur":0.68,"text":""},{"id":"oof-4","tags":["oof"],"start":83.64,"dur":0.53,"text":""},{"id":"oof-5","tags":["oof"],"start":84.42,"dur":0.84,"text":""},{"id":"oof-6","tags":["oof"],"start":85.51,"dur":0.59,"text":""},{"id":"oof-7","tags":["oof"],"start":86.35,"dur":0.54,"text":""},{"id":"oof-8","tags":["oof"],"start":87.14,"dur":0.57,"text":""},{"id":"ow","tags":["oof"],"start":87.96,"dur":0.97,"text":""},{"id":"we-can-help","tags":["explore","duck-story"],"start":89.18,"dur":1.86,"text":"Sir! I believe we can help."},{"id":"deployed","tags":["intro"],"start":91.29,"dur":3.23,"text":"My men are deployed throughout the room but tied up at the moment."},{"id":"free-em","tags":["explore"],"start":94.77,"dur":3.63,"text":"If you can free 'em, they'll get that phone down safely, guaranteed!"},{"id":"sound-off","tags":["intro"],"start":98.65,"dur":5.41,"text":"Men, where are ya? Sound off! Sound off! Roll call!"},{"id":"roll-call","tags":["intro"],"start":104.31,"dur":9.86,"text":"(The men sound off.)"},{"id":"good-luck","tags":["intro"],"start":114.42,"dur":2.73,"text":"That's all of them. Good luck."},{"id":"steady","tags":["chute","good"],"start":117.4,"dur":6.18,"text":"Steady... Steady... Careful now. Looking good, soldier. Amazing work!"},{"id":"situation","tags":["wave","duck-story"],"start":123.83,"dur":3.44,"text":"Psst! Sir! We have a situation, sir!"},{"id":"spotlights-trucks","tags":["explore"],"start":127.52,"dur":4.36,"text":"If you want to free 'em, watch out for the spotlights and patrolling trucks!"},{"id":"alarm","tags":["explore"],"start":132.13,"dur":2.94,"text":"If you're caught in the lights, an alarm will sound, and it's all over!"},{"id":"stealth","tags":["explore","duck-story"],"start":135.32,"dur":2.99,"text":"This rescue mission requires a covert, stealth approach."},{"id":"buttons","tags":["explore"],"start":138.56,"dur":3.71,"text":"Did you see the buttons that turn the lights off?"},{"id":"watch-spotlights","tags":["explore"],"start":142.52,"dur":2.88,"text":"Remember, watch out for those spotlights!"},{"id":"dont-land-on-me","tags":["land"],"start":145.65,"dur":3.93,"text":"Do not land on me! The telephone's the objective!"},{"id":"phone-target","tags":["combat","heli"],"start":149.83,"dur":3.09,"text":"Remember, the telephone is the target!"},{"id":"landing-zone","tags":["chute","heli"],"start":153.17,"dur":2.94,"text":"All right, men: the landing zone is that telephone. Got it?!"},{"id":"get-to-phone","tags":["start","heli"],"start":156.36,"dur":3.14,"text":"All right soldiers, let's get to that telephone!"},{"id":"land-close","tags":["chute"],"start":159.75,"dur":2.91,"text":"Land as close as you can to that telephone, men!"},{"id":"aiming-at","tags":["miss","duck-miss"],"start":162.91,"dur":1.94,"text":"Soldier, what are you aiming at?!"},{"id":"aiming","tags":["miss","combat","duck-miss"],"start":165.1,"dur":8.98,"text":"Soldier, what are you aiming at?! Do I look like a telephone to you? No? Well then hit the telephone!"},{"id":"hit-target","tags":["wave","start","combat","duck-story","duck-start"],"start":174.33,"dur":1.96,"text":"Let's hit that target!"}]}